tips.suggestion:
[重构思路] 让终止条件只依赖响应本身「是否还有数据」：取到空页才停止；或把页大小作为查询参数由客户端提出，并让响应用 `has_more` 显式表达是否被截断。
代码示例：
```rust
loop {
    let query = ChainInfoQuery::new(chain_id).with_received_log_excluding_first_n(offset);
    let info = remote_node.handle_chain_info_query(query).await?;
    let page = info.requested_received_log;
    if page.is_empty() {
        break;
    }
    offset += page.len() as u64;
    remote_log.extend(page);
}
```

[重构思路] 逐页增量处理：每取到一页就更新 chain→heights 映射，并保留一份轻量的位置索引（条目序号→是否已下载），避免持有一份完整 Vec；同时给循环加总条数/页数上限作为防护。
代码示例：
```rust
let mut max_pages = MAX_PAGES;
loop {
    let page = /* ... */;
    if page.is_empty() || max_pages == 0 { break; }
    max_pages -= 1;
    for entry in &page { remote_heights.entry(entry.chain_id).or_default().insert(entry.height); }
    offset += page.len() as u64;
}
```

[重构思路] 把上限移到 `linera-core/src/data_types.rs` 中与 `ChainInfoQuery`/`ChainInfo` 相邻（或改为查询参数 `request_received_log_page_size: Option<u64>`），让 client 与 worker 都从契约层读取同一语义。
代码示例：
```rust
// data_types.rs
/// Maximum number of `received_log` entries returned in one `ChainInfo`.
pub const CHAIN_INFO_MAX_RECEIVED_LOG_ENTRIES: usize = 1000;
```

[重构思路] 显式表达意图：先按 count 判断是否还有数据，再计算合法区间；并在注释中说明依赖 read 的夹取行为，避免出现 start>end。
代码示例：
```rust
let count = chain.received_log.count();
if start < count {
    let end = start.saturating_add(CHAIN_INFO_MAX_RECEIVED_LOG_ENTRIES).min(count);
    info.requested_received_log = chain.received_log.read(start..end).await?;
}
```
